{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓星申敏兒、李鍾碩、朱智勛及李世榮主演的串流劇《再婚皇后》近日大結局，申敏兒昨日接受韓媒訪問，大爆丈夫金宇彬亦是《再》劇的忠實觀眾：「他看得好投入，覺得『娜菲爾（申敏兒劇中角色）』好可憐，和喜歡《再》劇的觀眾一樣，一邊罵一邊看。</p><p>」她又指除了</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:55:06.847938+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T06:32:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T06:48:16.311058+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T06:48:16.311058+00:00","content_hash":"a2b3ba9d6a9a0f15bae8e9e96290314d94dd2ce16e48d7167a6e7d55cb9b5982","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}